<InfoPage title="About" eyebrow="Ringside since 1980">
  <p>The Workrate Report is written by a fan who started watching in 1980 and never stopped: the NWA and Jim Crockett Promotions, WCW, the UWF, the USWA, the AWA, the WWF and the independents, through to today's WWE, AEW and New Japan.</p>
  <p>Cagematch tells you what the crowd thought. This site tells you why: one voice, one scale, and the context of having watched it the first time around.</p>
  <p class="muted">A longer story is on the way.</p>
</InfoPage>
